ans\">谢谢你每一次。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">マイナス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">减；减法；减去；负数；赤字；亏损；不利；缺点；劣势；负电荷；阴极；负极；负号；减号；负面的；不好的；阴性的；呈阴性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缠绕；卷起；包裹；戴（头巾、围巾等）；包住；笼罩；迂回；绕过；联句；提前（三小时等）；提前进行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125924\"><ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>巻<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれろ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把它包围在漫长的事情上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">撒く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">撒；洒；散布；分发；散发；甩掉；摆脱；甩脱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195707\">まいた<ruby>種<rp>(</rp><rt>たね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>刈<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らねばならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">种植的种子必须切割。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">蒔く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"p